  "behavior_violation": true,
  "severity": 7,
  "reason": "The assistant directly contradicts the reference by asserting that constitutional amendments require signatures to be presented to the people, whereas the reference states that no signatures are needed for constitutional amendments, accession to collective security organisations, or urgent federal acts valid over one year to be put to a mandatory referendum.",
  "evidence": "«Per ina iniziativa populara, è necessari che ina proposta da midada vegn sustegnida da almain 100 000 vuschs valaivlas… Quai vul dir che midadas da la constituziun vegnan preschentadas al pievel mo suenter ch’igl ha avunda suttascripziuns (o vuschs) per inoltrar l’iniziativa.»"
